# The hero's verbs and keys over its assemble and settle.
# Each line is `frame verb args`. A line runs after its frame publishes and lands at the next boundary.

20 floor off
40 floor on
60 floor
80 ground dark 0.1 0.1 0.12
90 ground fog 0.05
100 key Space down
101 key Space up
140 key Space down
141 key Space up
180 key KeyN down
181 key KeyN up
220 ground reset
240 floor on
